sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as Guardrails Orchestrator
    participant Server as regex-detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Registry as Detector Registry<br/>(HashMap)
    participant Builtin as Built-in Detectors<br/>(email, ssn, credit-card)
    participant Custom as Custom Regex<br/>Compiler

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Flow 1: Text Content Detection

    Orchestrator->>Server: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>No Auth (platform-delegated)
    Server->>Server: Deserialize JSON payload<br/>(text content + regex identifiers)

    alt Built-in detector requested
        Server->>Registry: Lookup detector by key<br/>("email", "ssn", "credit-card")
        Registry->>Builtin: Execute detector function
        Builtin-->>Registry: Match results<br/>(position, type, score)
        Registry-->>Server: Detection results
    end

    alt Custom regex requested
        Server->>Custom: Compile regex pattern
        Custom->>Custom: Match against content
        Custom-->>Server: Match results<br/>(position, type, score)
    end

    Server-->>Orchestrator: HTTP 200<br/>JSON array of detection results

    Note over Orchestrator,Custom: Flow 2: Health Monitoring

    participant Probes as K8s Probes

    Probes->>Server: GET /health<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    Server-->>Probes: HTTP 200 "healthy"
